# Auto-enter the Nix dev shell (flake.nix) on cd into the repo, so the pinned
# toolchain and the half-cores test/build cap are always active — bare
# `cargo test` "just works" without remembering `nix develop`.
#
# One-time setup per machine: install direnv + nix, then run `direnv allow`.
# Without direnv, use `nix develop` manually.
use flake
